      "id": "s1-intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "label": null,
      "title": "DAY6 — You Were Beautiful",
      "content": "이번 레슨에서는 **-던**을 배워요.\n\n-던은 과거의 기억이나 추억을 떠올릴 때 사용해요.\n\nDAY6의 'You Were Beautiful'로 연습해 봐요!",
      "contentEnglish": "In this lesson, we'll learn **-던** (past retrospective modifier).\n\n-던 is used when recalling memories or past events.\n\nLet's practice with DAY6's 'You Were Beautiful'!",
      "musicPlaying": true
    },
